{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Thanks for checking out the Deep Fringe demo!</i></strong><i> In this work-in-progress build, you'll step into the unknown, test your tactics skills, and get a glimpse of what Deep Fringe has to offer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/wishlist.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a grim post-apocalyptic world, you'll lead a squad with unique abilities in turn-based combat, where strategic mastery of the environment is key to survival.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/the_terrain_is_your_domain_EN.png?t=1744251121\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate and transform spaces; modify, destroy, or replace grid elements to exploit terrain height and effects, gaining tactical advantages by strategically positioning your squad.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Manipulating_the_Grid_EN.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/biopiunk_nightmare_en.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face terrifying foes: Toxic tumors, spores, larva swarms, and bio-technologically modified enemies. Challenge these threats or take on dangerous mercenaries in tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Unit_Attack_EN.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with unique squad compositions and devastating firepower in this demo. Get a glimpse of unit customization by upgrading your arsenal and equipping powerful item enhancements to maximize your squad\u2019s abilities before battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Skill_Tree.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Titanic_Domination.png?t=1744251121\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle with ultra-large units  that control multiple grids, capable of unleashing devastating attacks and altering the flow of battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Monster_Fight.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Edit_Levels_Create_legends.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employ the built-in graphical editor to easily create your own levels and battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/editor.gif?t=1744251121\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Keep_friends_close_enemies_closer.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make strategic choices that introduce you to the world\u2019s conflicts and shape your path as you form alliances or rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Story_Choise.gif?t=1744251121\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3073010?t=1744251121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/87ff4e9f421a49a124c8d867f14c7340118ff855/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744251121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744251121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744251121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Deep Fringe contains violence in the form of tactical combat, including the use of firearms and melee weapons. The theme explorers survival under harsh conditions."},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Discord_Join_Community.png?t=1744251121\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Thanks for checking out the Deep Fringe demo!</i></strong><i> In this work-in-progress build, you'll step into the unknown, test your tactics skills, and get a glimpse of what Deep Fringe has to offer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/wishlist.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a grim post-apocalyptic world, you'll lead a squad with unique abilities in turn-based combat, where strategic mastery of the environment is key to survival.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/the_terrain_is_your_domain_EN.png?t=1744251121\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate and transform spaces; modify, destroy, or replace grid elements to exploit terrain height and effects, gaining tactical advantages by strategically positioning your squad.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Manipulating_the_Grid_EN.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/biopiunk_nightmare_en.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face terrifying foes: Toxic tumors, spores, larva swarms, and bio-technologically modified enemies. Challenge these threats or take on dangerous mercenaries in tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Unit_Attack_EN.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with unique squad compositions and devastating firepower in this demo. Get a glimpse of unit customization by upgrading your arsenal and equipping powerful item enhancements to maximize your squad\u2019s abilities before battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Skill_Tree.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Titanic_Domination.png?t=1744251121\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle with ultra-large units  that control multiple grids, capable of unleashing devastating attacks and altering the flow of battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Monster_Fight.gif?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Edit_Levels_Create_legends.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employ the built-in graphical editor to easily create your own levels and battles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/editor.gif?t=1744251121\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Keep_friends_close_enemies_closer.png?t=1744251121\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make strategic choices that introduce you to the world\u2019s conflicts and shape your path as you form alliances or rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/extras/Story_Choise.gif?t=1744251121\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Bosoneon Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3067920","name":"Deep Fringe"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073010/header.jpg?t=1744251121","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118752,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118752/movie480.mp4?t=1743595642","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118752/movie_max.mp4?t=1743595642"},"name":"Demo Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118752/f94934bca2d3cfa1010f24ad59bbb4838d550a0f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743595642","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118752/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743595642","ma