121"}],"short_description":"Deep Fringe is a deep tactical RPG set in a biopunk post-apocalyptic wasteland. Lead powerful factions in turn-based brutal battles, leveraging the strategic use of an interactive environment. Modify or destroy terrain to achieve tactical supremacy. Craft legendary chapters with the level editor.","steam_appid":3073010,"support_info":{"email":"bosoneonco@outlook.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"demo","website":null}